# Live-URL parity: the MkDocs site (use_directory_urls default) served
# these paths. The rebuild folds their content into the new pages, so
# 301 the old URLs to the new homes. Real standalone pages exist for
# /privacy, /trademark, /manufacturer-federal-validation, /contact,
# /spec — those need no redirect. Netlify normalizes the trailing
# slash, so `/foo` also matches `/foo/`.
/compatible-runtimes      /partners     301
/manufacturer-directory   /partners     301
/manufacturers            /partners     301
/integrations             /partners     301
/submit                   /compliance   301
/list-your-product        /join         301
/manifesto                /what         301
/contact-sent             /submitted    301
